    "id": "ouruber",
    "name": "OurUber",
    "year": "2026",
    "status": "Completed",
    "subtitle": "Ride-hailing app for clients and drivers",
    "description": "A ride-hailing app I designed and built end to end, where the same account can request rides or drive. Each ride goes from request to rating in real time, with a map, pickup time and a short window to accept the driver's offer.",
    "features": [
      "Request: origin and destination picked on the map, with the address filled in from the location",
      "Driver mode: open requests nearby with the pickup time, and one tap to offer the ride",
      "Live ride: the client has three minutes to accept the offer, then follows each step until both confirm the end",
      "Trips and ratings: history by state, 1 to 5 star ratings and each driver's average on the profile"
    ],
